{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人張繼聰當年以歌手身份入行，但近日卻轉戰影壇，似乎已經「拍戲拍到唔記得咗唱歌」。</p><p>近日他終宣布短暫返回歌手舞台，將於明年3月到訪馬來西亞，於雲頂舉行《This Is Louis》演唱會，消息傳出後令當地粉絲大感興奮，相信將掀起撲飛熱。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:23:57.739778+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T02:01:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T02:17:16.907970+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T02:17:16.907970+00:00","content_hash":"f7049b37e5acb02441e9d6c63e66e41423ef725d0e594547c6fb9b7e0a845a23","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}